            <chunk name="Object" index="49">
              <items count="3">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f165add0-a047-409e-a008-dd9cf82605f3</item>
                <item name="Lib" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2e38bada-fd78-4b1a-a943-dc06595af3d5</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Factors</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Factors

Based on the probed simulation and the weather data, this component calculates wind velocities, wind factors for each probing point [8760 hourly branches x number of probing points].
The wind factors are calculated based on the wind velocity and direction for each hour which is scaled up/down accordingly given probing height from ground.
For this, we support either a look-up for the closest simulated wind direction or an interpolation between the closest two wind directions.

Eddy3D 0.3.8.2</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">eae48e07-2827-42b1-9771-cb5af619ba8f</item>
                    <item name="Interpolation" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Factors</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Factors</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="7">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
